  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Ensuring inclusive risk-informed shock-responsive SP resulting in more resilient BARMM communities</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The long term desired vision of change is for the poorest and most vulnerable population in BARMM to be able to mitigate risks, better prepare and appropriately respond to various shocks and stress, with timely access to inclusive, risk-informed and shock responsive social protection systems.</narrative>
  </description>
